{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/page,_N_T_/about"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/about/__PAGE__","/about","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--Q5K0UX1dTfp8SZPg_L6Wj--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/806bdb8e4a6a9b95.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3a7ba59533961d35.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d702a24e2b6c48fa.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-53420ca41719f304.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4b421af3782959a9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9006a9dbed1389eb.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Personal Portfolio</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Crafting code, capturing light, and making some noise.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_5901b7c6-module__ec5Qua__variable jetbrains_mono_8be3b53a-module__CxiPNW__variable antialiased relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none grainy opacity-20\"></div><main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#060606] text-neutral-400 font-light selection:bg-white selection:text-black pb-32\"><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 p-6 grid grid-cols-3 items-center bg-[#060606]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-neutral-900/50\"><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><a href=\"/\"><span class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">[</span><span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">&lt; Back</span><span class=\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">]</span></span></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><h1 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-normal tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-300 uppercase\">About</h1></div><div class=\"flex justify-end\"><a href=\"/photos/uploads/resume_tech_eng.pdf\"><span class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 font-sans transition-colors duration-300 text-sm text-neutral-500 hover:text-white\"><span class=\"mr-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">[</span><span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase\">Resume</span><span class=\"ml-2 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\">]</span></span></a></div></header><main class=\"pt-48 px-6 md:px-12 max-w-[1800px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-32 border-b border-neutral-800 pb-12\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-neutral-200 mb-6 uppercase\">Cheerful Nonsense.</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-neutral-500 font-mono tracking-tighter mb-8\">&gt; My monologue.</p><div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-wrap\">Hi. I&#x27;m Zuocheng Wang.  I&#x27;m currently in University of Pittsburgh undergraduate program, majoring &#x27;Computer Science&#x27; and &#x27;Digital Narrative &amp; Interactive Design&#x27;. I’d like to think of myself as someone with a broad range of interests. If you walked up to me and started talking about your hobbies, no matter what they are, I could probably hold my own in the conversation. \n\nI’ve always had a bone to pick with the Chinese public education system’s obsession with sorting people into &quot;Arts vs. Sciences.&quot; It creates this false dichotomy, subtly erasing the possibility of being both. To me, art decides the destination, while technology decides how to get there; possessing both is the truly rare skill of our time. This isn&#x27;t &quot;distraction&quot; or &quot;unproductive.&quot; My enjoyment is my greatest priority.\n\nAs the headline says, &quot;The world is a cheerful nonsense&quot; (Hermann Hesse). There is no singular, noble &quot;meaning&quot; out there that demands we sacrifice infinite possibilities in our short lives. Look, the world is getting more beautiful by the second.\n\nThis page was originally intended to be a traditional CV. However, since the cool stuffs I made are already documented in their respective sections, and my formal academic information and technical history can be found in my resume linked in the corner, a standard CV felt redundant here. Instead, I&#x27;ve converted this space into a living archive, a repository for monologues, fragments, and late-night thoughts. Welcome to the journal.</div></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-16 mb-64\"><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2026-02-24-the-future-is-yet-to-come\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">FEB 24, 2026</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">The future is yet to come</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">Don&#x27;t want to limit myself.</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2026-02-16-exhausted\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">FEB 16, 2026</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">Exhausted</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">&quot;I miss you. What are you up to?&quot;</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2026-01-03-to-the-god-of-instant-noodles\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">JAN 2, 2026</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">To the God of Instant Noodles</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">I must have been hallucinating at the time; I should have gone to bed earlier.</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2025-12-10-airport-5-30-am\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">DEC 9, 2025</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">Airport, 5:30 AM</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">The airport is a magical place.</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2025-11-27-on-the-cliffs\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">NOV 26, 2025</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">On the Cliffs</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">I’m dying. I can feel it.</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"block group\" href=\"/about/2026-04-24-the-first-monologue\"><div class=\"w-full transition-all duration-700 ease-in-out border-b border-neutral-900 pb-8 opacity-40 translate-y-4\"><div class=\"transition-colors duration-700 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col space-y-6 bg-transparent\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 tracking-[0.3em]\">MAY 2, 2025</div><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-light transition-colors duration-700 uppercase tracking-tight text-neutral-400\">The Way Home</h2></div><p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl font-light italic\">Thank you. Thank the world.</p><div class=\"pt-4\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-600 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">[ Read Passage ]</span></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left\"><p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600 font-mono\">//<!-- --> Thinking in public.</p></div></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/20d1a56625def336.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/4b421af3782959a9.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/9006a9dbed1389eb.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\nd:I[68027,[],\\\"default\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/330a17ddee87f907.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/70bc3e132a0a741e-s.p.15008bfb.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\\\",\